  "worked_solution": "The first non-zero entry of each row (from left to right) is the leading entry. \n\nTherefore, the leading entries of the $1$st and $4$th rows of  $A$ are $-4$ and $9$, respectively.\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -9 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 9 & -8 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 9 & -1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSo, the answer is $-4+9=5.$",
